  "idea": "Linear Insights update for software engineering velocity tracking",
  "text": "Stop manually copying customer bug reports from Zendesk into Jira backlog tickets. Support engineers lose hours each week copy-pasting error logs, customer emails, and duplicate tickets between tabs. That manual data transfer creates fragmented issue descriptions and leaves customer tickets hanging when fixes deploy. Linear Customer Requests links Zendesk tickets directly to engineering cycles and auto-notifies reps upon deployment. You close the customer feedback loop seamlessly.",
